WEBVTT

00:33:59.450 --> 00:34:02.521
we want to have leadership in that area.

00:34:02.922 --> 00:34:06.398
That's had, in your view,
a very real impact

00:34:06.422 --> 00:34:10.961
on how cities across China
have embraced AI start-ups

00:34:10.985 --> 00:34:13.094
and really seeded success in a way

00:34:13.118 --> 00:34:15.976
that is not happening
at the same scale in the US, right?

00:34:16.331 --> 00:34:18.236
KFL: Yes, between these two factors,

00:34:18.260 --> 00:34:21.164
I think data is actually more important.

00:34:21.188 --> 00:34:24.798
China is a large market.

00:34:24.822 --> 00:34:27.771
Not only does it have
more breadth in the users,

00:34:27.795 --> 00:34:31.336
but also more depth in the usage per user.